<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH FINMIN SELL &amp; BUY TENDER AVE YIELD 18.01 PCT.</title>
<headline>CZECH FINMIN SELL &amp; BUY TENDER AVE YIELD 18.01 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yield in a Czech Finance Ministry overnight sell and buy tender organised by the Czech National Bank (CNB) reached 18.01 percent, the CNB said on Monday.</p>
<p>The CNB said that it accepted 27.55 percent of bids at the maximum level of 18.10 percent.</p>
<p>The limit yield set in the tender was 18.20 percent.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
